msgid "Manage your @mention and keyword notifications"
msgstr "@멘션 및 키워드 알림 관리"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:7
msgid ""
"You're :doc:`notified </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"notifications>` in a :doc:`web browser </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-web-notifications>`, the :doc:`desktop app </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications>`, and on your "
":doc:`mobile device </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-"
"notifications>`, when you're @mentioned by your username or first name, "
"@mentioned as part of a user group, and for matches to keywords you're "
"following."
msgstr ""
"사용자 ID나 이름으로 @멘션되거나, 사용자 그룹의 일원으로 @멘션되거나, "
"팔로우 중인 키워드와 일치하는 경우 :doc:`웹 브라우저 </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications>`, :doc:`데스크톱 앱 </end-"
"user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications>`, :doc:`모바일 "
"기기 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-notifications>`\\ 에서 "
":doc:`알림 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications>`\\ 을 "
"받습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:9
msgid ""
"You're also notified when someone uses channel-wide :doc:`@mentions "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-people>` including :ref:`@channel "
"and @all <end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-people:@channel and @all>`, "
"as well as :ref:`@here <end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-"
"people:@here>`."
msgstr ""
"또한 누군가가 :ref:`@channel 및 @all <end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-"
"people:@channel and @all>`\\ 과 :ref:`@here <end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/mention-people:@here>`\\ 를 포함한 채널 전체 :doc:`@멘션 </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/mention-people>`\\ 을 사용할 때도 알림을 받습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:11
msgid ""
"For all other messages, channels appear bolded to indicate unread "
"activity."
msgstr "그 밖의 모든 메시지의 경우 채널이 굵게 표시되어 읽지 않은 활동을 나타냅니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:14
msgid "Customize notification keywords"
msgstr "알림 키워드 사용자 지정"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:16
msgid ""
"Using a web browser or the desktop app, you can customize keywords to "
"trigger notifications. Keywords aren't case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"웹 브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서 알림을 트리거하는 키워드를 사용자 지정할 수 "
"있습니다. 키워드는 대소문자를 구분하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:18
msgid ""
"For example, you can receive notifications for all messages and threads "
"related to a specific topic, project name, or customer."
msgstr ""
"예를 들어 특정 주제, 프로젝트 이름, 고객과 관련된 모든 메시지와 스레드에 대해 "
"알림을 받을 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:20
msgid "A walkthrough of setting keywords that trigger mentions in Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 멘션을 트리거하는 키워드를 설정하는 과정 안내."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:25
msgid ""
"Separate multiple keywords using commas or by pressing :kbd:`Tab`, and "
"use :kbd:`Backspace` to manage keywords."
msgstr ""
"여러 키워드는 쉼표나 :kbd:`Tab` 키로 구분하고, :kbd:`Backspace` 키로 키워드를 "
"관리합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:28
msgid "Passively track keywords (no notification)"
msgstr "키워드 수동 추적(알림 없음)"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:30
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v9.3, Mattermost Enterprise and Professional customers "
"interested calling attention to specific topics of interest across "
"channels can do so without sending notifications to a Mattermost client."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v9.3부터 Mattermost Enterprise 및 Professional 고객은 여러 채널에 "
"걸쳐 관심 있는 특정 주제에 주의를 환기하고 싶을 때 OKR.BEST 클라이언트로 알림을 "
"보내지 않고도 그렇게 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:32
msgid ""
"Using a web browser or the desktop app, you can passively track key terms"
" by specifying single or multiple words to be highlighted in all channels"
" you're a member of. Keywords and phrases are automatically highlighted "
"using a color based on your :doc:`Mattermost theme </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/customize-your-theme>`."
msgstr ""
"웹 브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서 구성원으로 속한 모든 채널에서 강조 표시할 단어를 "
"하나 또는 여러 개 지정해 핵심 용어를 수동으로 추적할 수 있습니다. 키워드와 "
"문구는 :doc:`OKR.BEST 테마 </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-"
"theme>`\\ 를 기반으로 한 색상으로 자동 강조됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications.rst:34
msgid "A walkthrough of setting keywords that are highlighted in Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 강조 표시되는 키워드를 설정하는 과정 안내."

